    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy feels like just another chore to add to the list. another thing to pretend at. i just want the noise to stop. i just want the quiet. i wish i could just... turn everything off so i wouldn't have to feel this heavy nothingness anymore. is there even a way to get back to feeling real, or is this just how it is now?",
